353 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 262 0 R
/E (The Mechanical Engineering Department of GEC Patan, in collaboration with Khodiyar CAD Centre Ahmedabad, organized a two-day online workshop on ANSYS Mechanical and Computational Fluid Dynamics \(CFD\) from 18th to 19th March 2025. Coordinated by Prof. R. A. Oza, the workshop was designed for Semester 4 and Semester 6 students, as well as faculty members, with the aim of enhancing their understanding of advanced simulation techniques and their applications in engineering.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
354 0 obj
<<
