/P 264 0 R
/E (The Mechanical Engineering Department of Government Engineering College, Patan organized an industrial visit to Neptune Industries Limited, Mehsana, to provide students with practical exposure to industrial processes and technologies used in manufacturing. Known for producing machinery related to building construction materials, sanitary ware, porcelain insulators, refractory, and technical ceramics, Neptune Industries offered students valuable insights into real-time operations and professional interactions, effectively bridging the gap between theoretical knowledge and practical application.)
/Pg 15 0 R
